                    <li class="mb-2">✔ HSN/SAC code column for each item</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Auto‑calculation of tax amounts</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Clear "Tax Invoice" labelling for compliance</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

